  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only scvi_n200 with multiprofile avgpool is the strongest unimodal baseline (0.650; transformer nearly identical), while image-only multiprofile avgpool is weak (ResNet 0.328, ViT 0.332), leaving uncertainty about whether image features are complementary and whether simple fusion can improve over RNA-only. config_030 tests this by keeping the strong RNA settings and adding a tested ResNet image branch with the simplest concat fusion, making it directly comparable to config_005. It is the best next experiment because it evaluates the central multimodal question with minimal added complexity and will clarify whether to invest in weighted/transformer/ViT multimodal variants or remain RNA-only."
}

